{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%lld cards are due." : {
      "comment" : "Daily reminder text: how many cards (reviews and learning cards) are due. Plural variations by count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld card is due."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld cards are due."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "復習待ちのカードが%lld枚あります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %lld 张卡片待复习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld new cards are ready to learn." : {
      "comment" : "Daily reminder text: how many new cards can be learned that day. Plural variations by count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld new card is ready to learn."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld new cards are ready to learn."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しく学習できるカードが%lld枚あります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %lld 张新卡片可以学习。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to Study" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the daily study reminder notification.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学習の時間です"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该学习了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily Reminder" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the daily study reminder, as a Settings row and the reminder screen's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎日のリマインダー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每日提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hayaki is not allowed to send notifications, so the reminder cannot appear. To get it, allow notifications for Hayaki in the Settings app, then turn the reminder on." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when the learner refused notifications, explaining how to allow them later.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hayakiの通知が許可されていません。「設定」アプリでHayakiの通知を許可してから、リマインダーをオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hayaki 没有通知权限。请在“设置”应用中允许 Hayaki 发送通知，然后开启提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next Reminder" : {
      "comment" : "Header of the section showing when the next reminder comes and what it says.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次のリマインダー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "Shown next to Daily Reminder in Settings when the reminder is off.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Hayaki reminds you how many cards are due. On a day with nothing to study, there is no reminder." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation below the daily reminder switch.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hayakiは1日1回、復習待ちのカードの枚数をお知らせします。学習するカードがない日は通知しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hayaki 每天提醒你有多少张卡片待复习。当天没有卡片需要学习时，不会发出提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Button that opens Hayaki's notification settings in the Settings app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定を開く"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The count is updated whenever your collection changes. Reviews done on another device are counted after you sync." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation below the next reminder of how its due count stays current.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コレクションが更新されるたびに枚数も更新されます。他の端末での復習は、同期後に反映されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "集合发生变化时会更新卡片数量。在其他设备上完成的复习会在同步后计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the reminder's time of day.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時間"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the date and time of the next reminder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日時"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒时间"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
